{"id":"662066","name":"青红萝卜羊排汤","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662066/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"羊排","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"青萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"羊排冷水下锅焯烫出血水后洗净。","img":"images/662066/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"胡萝卜和青萝卜去皮洗净。","img":"images/662066/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"胡萝卜切滚刀块。","img":"images/662066/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"青萝卜切滚刀块。","img":"images/662066/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"羊排放入锅中。","img":"images/662066/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量清水和几块姜片。","img":"images/662066/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"电高压锅焖煮牛羊肉30分钟。","img":"images/662066/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"羊肉焖好软烂。","img":"images/662066/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入青红萝卜，煲30分钟左右。","img":"images/662066/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"出锅前加盐调味即可。","img":"images/662066/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662066/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662066/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662066/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}